{"kp_id": "zj-005.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-005", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "肺与大肠表里：小肠火蒸腾使大肠残渣之水气化，上归于肺成肺津。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.da_chang", "zangfu.fei", "concept.biao_li"], "chapter_id": "zj-005.c01", "evidence_quote": "那大肠和肺是表里啊，我刚刚不是讲了吗", "seg_from": 5, "seg_to": 9, "start_s": 26.79, "end_s": 59.13, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OyXQdYVOYek", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OyXQdYVOYek&t=26s", "series": "zj", "episode": 5, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 05", "start_s": 26.79, "end_s": 59.13}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-005.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-005", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "丑时（1–3点）反复醒来提示肝经/肝脏问题；治后能一觉到天亮为好转。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.gan", "new.concept.子午流注"], "chapter_id": "zj-005.c02", "evidence_quote": "晚上一点到三点是肝经气血留住的时候", "seg_from": 136, "seg_to": 180, "start_s": 703.81, "end_s": 964.6, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OyXQdYVOYek", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OyXQdYVOYek&t=703s", "series": "zj", "episode": 5, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 05", "start_s": 703.81, "end_s": 964.6}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "留住=流注", "source": "llm_read"}
